    <string name="share_howto_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="share_howto_1">1. Turn on sharing above and connect Forough.</string>
    <string name="share_howto_2">2. On the other device, open its proxy/VPN settings and set the HTTP proxy to the address shown here (or scan the QR code).</string>
    <string name="share_howto_3">3. The other device\'s traffic now rides this phone\'s Forough tunnel — works over Wi-Fi and hotspot.</string>
    <string name="share_warning">Only share with people you trust: everything they do goes through your tunnel and your carrier connection.</string>
